# Construction material procurement rules (data, evaluated by TividyEngineFacade::runWorkflow)
# stepId | ruleId | name | field | operator | operand | comparedText | failureText
# Lookup values (authorityLimit, approvedSuppliers, materialRemaining) are placed in the instance
# payload from the procurement reference data.
proc-submit | authority | Requester authority | amount | <= | @authorityLimit | R{amount} <= authority limit R{authorityLimit} ({requesterRole}) | The request exceeds your approval limit of R{authorityLimit}.
proc-spec | material | Material specified | material | nonEmpty |  | Material: {material} | The material is missing.
proc-spec | quantity | Quantity specified | quantity | nonEmpty |  | Quantity: {quantity} | The quantity is missing.
proc-spec | cost | Estimated cost | amount | > | 0 | Estimated cost R{amount} is positive | The estimated cost must be greater than zero.
proc-spec | delivery | Delivery date | deliveryDate | nonEmpty |  | Delivery date: {deliveryDate} | The delivery date is missing.
proc-quote | supplier | Approved supplier | supplier | in | @approvedSuppliers | {supplier} is on the approved supplier list | The selected supplier is not approved for procurement.
proc-approve | funding | Funding | amount | <= | @materialRemaining | R{amount} requested; R{materialRemaining} remaining for {material} | Insufficient funds remain for {material}.
